# 统一换行 / Line ending policy
#
# 仓库内文本一律以 LF 存入并检出。本项目有多处「逐字节比较」的校验
# （词表生成物一致性、构建产物哈希），Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会把
# 工作区改成 CRLF，让这些校验在本地假失败、在 CI 通过——同一个提交两种结论。
#
# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF. This repo has byte-exact
# checks (lexicon artifact sync, build output hashes); on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true those checks fail locally yet pass in CI. Pinning LF makes
# the verdict identical on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本与钩子必须保持 LF，否则在 Linux 容器里会 exec 失败
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# 二进制资源不参与任何换行/编码转换
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.avif binary
*.heic binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
